    "body": "fix on issue/3612-preview-march-steps · PR #3676 · pinned by a_grazing_faced_floor_resolves_and_stays_see_through · merges when reviewed\n\nCause: the preview march stopped after 64 steps. A ray at a small angle to a faced floor did not reach the floor in 64 steps, so the pixel showed the background. The march now takes up to 256 steps. A ray that still runs out gets a hit only where material is proved on the ray.\n\n@mechatronics-studio, please build the branch `issue/3612-preview-march-steps` and look at your part again at a low view angle. Tell us here if you still see holes in the cut stock.\n",
